WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:06.102
Call sheets live at one link, so everyone has the latest.

2
00:00:06.352 --> 00:00:13.702
Every version is kept. Go back to V1, then forward to V3 to see what changed.

3
00:00:13.952 --> 00:00:18.503
You can see how many crew have opened it.

4
00:00:18.753 --> 00:00:25.304
Send it by WhatsApp or email, or share an edit link with your coordinator.

5
00:00:25.554 --> 00:00:35.264
Crew just open the link. No login.

